## Dataset

For this mentorship, we will be working with the **Olist Brazilian E-Commerce dataset** from Kaggle.

**Dataset:** [Olist Brazilian E-Commerce Public Dataset] https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/olistbr/brazilian-ecommerce

### How to Download

1. Open the Kaggle dataset using the link above.
2. Click **Download**.
3. **Do not download the individual CSV files shown in the sidebar.**
4. In the download options, scroll down and select **Download as ZIP**.
5. Extract the ZIP file on your computer.
6. Keep the CSV files together in the extracted folder — we will use them during the practical session.

> **Important:** Download the dataset as a **ZIP file**, not as individual CSV files.
